. /* --------------------------------------
> 
> This program graphs the long-term trend in
> eligibility for TennCare.
> 
> --------------------------------------- */
. 
. clear all

. estimates clear

. set mem 50m
set memory ignored.
    Memory no longer needs to be set in modern Statas; memory adjustments are
    performed on the fly automatically.

. 
. 
